 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Killing children or a soul: nothing drawn. «إلا بالحق» (151:30-37) is not glossed: Al-Muyassar's list of capital cases is not displayed. Hands for «وبالوالدين إحسانا», scales for «الكيل والميزان» (weights, not the Mizan), a seal for «وبعهد الله أوفوا», footsteps for «صراطي مستقيما», two paths for «ولا تتبعوا السبل». «الوصايا العشر» is the common name of these verses. STAGING v4: Each commandment only as an everyday act, nothing invented. c1 (151) at home: two believers sitting; the invitation of 151:1-7 is not acted (the Prophet is not shown, nobody walks toward him, no plate on «قل»). Geometric for not associating anything with Him (151:8-11); they raise their hands on 151:13 (Al-Muyassar: kindness to parents by dutifulness and du'a; the parents are not drawn); a wheat plate for «نرزقكم وإياهم» (151:20); no child is drawn and nothing is drawn for either killing (151:14-18, 151:30-37); a head shake on 151:24 (keeping away from immoralities, no woman on stage); they read on 151:39 (what He has enjoined). c2 (152) in a market: the guardian (a believer) walks over to him (152:7) and hands the grown orphan his property on 152:11 (both tafsirs: give him his wealth when he reaches maturity); scales for full measure and weight (152:13-15, not the Mizan); he speaks justly on 152:22; a seal for Allah's covenant (152:28-30). c3 (153) on the road: believers walk along the straight path on 153:5 (footsteps plate); the other ways are only the two-paths plate; nobody splits off (the scattering is a prohibition, not acted)."
 },
